<div class="section pb-0" style="display: none;">
    <div id="listSubDestination" class="container">
        <div class="row sub-destination">
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-5 mb-4">
                <h6 class="text-muted">Nusa Penida & Nusa Ceningan & Nusa Lembongan</h6>
                <h3 class="mb-2">A Very Thrilling Destination</h3>
                <p>With a rich marine life--think endless corals and impressive pelagics--and unparalleled drift dive sites, the Nusa Islands make for a very thrilling destination. It’s the cherry on top for divers visiting Bali! On the ground, you’ll find yourself intoxicated with the variety of gorgeous white sand beaches and incredibly scenic views, infused with an authentic Bali feel.</p>
                <ul class="list-small mb-3">
                    <li>Experience the best flying sensation in drift dives over Nusa Penida’s breathtaking reefs</li>
                    <li>Encounter the pelagics everyone is raving about, mola mola and mantas, up close</li>
                    <li>Get those adrenaline running while cliff jumping at Nusa Ceningan</li>
                    <li>Take lots of Instagramable pictures at the Nusa Islands’ scenic beaches</li>
